{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ellentis is a strategic card game set in a unique world of five elements. Simple rules hide a depth of gameplay, where every decision matters. Create combinations, manage your hand and maximize points by arranging cards in a circle on the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Each card</u></strong> in the game has parameters such as:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Color</strong> - red, yellow, green, blue, brown </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rank</strong> - 1, 2, 3, 4, 5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Material</strong> - Each of the 13 materials provides unique mechanics during the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Essence</strong> - The degree of essence of a card affects the score of the arrangement in the circle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Circle mechanics</strong> - cards are placed in 5 slots in a circle on the board, and then all created arrangements are scored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Slot upgrade mechanics</strong> - Each slot in the circle can be upgraded to provide an additional effect. Use this opportunity on your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Special Powers</strong> - You'll be able to use 3 special powers of your choice during the game, which you'll use at critical moments to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Different deck types</strong> - Each deck is a new way to play the game to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Achievement System</strong> - For each achievement you earn in the game, you unlock new content: new decks, card materials, slot upgrades, and special powers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Easy to learn, hard to master</strong> - every game is a new challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment with combinations, plan your moves, and discover how far you can go in the world of <strong>Ellentis</strong>!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3586740?t=1747691882","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586740/34e5a1f8f3d18d04634c05b0779b84619e480f2d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747691882","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586740/209061793ae7ecd26098b8431abe3e58050cf461/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747691882","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586740/209061793ae7ecd26098b8431abe3e58050cf461/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747691882","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ellentis is a strategic card game set in a unique world of five elements. Simple rules hide a depth of gameplay, where every decision matters. Create combinations, manage your hand and maximize points by arranging cards in a circle on the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Each card</u></strong> in the game has parameters such as:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Color</strong> - red, yellow, green, blue, brown </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rank</strong> - 1, 2, 3, 4, 5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Material</strong> - Each of the 13 materials provides unique mechanics during the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Essence</strong> - The degree of essence of a card affects the score of the arrangement in the circle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Circle mechanics</strong> - cards are placed in 5 slots in a circle on the board, and then all created arrangements are scored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Slot upgrade mechanics</strong> - Each slot in the circle can be upgraded to provide an additional effect. Use this opportunity on your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Special Powers</strong> - You'll be able to use 3 special powers of your choice during the game, which you'll use at critical moments to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Different deck types</strong> - Each deck is a new way to play the game to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Achievement System</strong> - For each achievement you earn in the game, you unlock new content: new decks, card materials, slot upgrades, and special powers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Easy to learn, hard to master</strong> - every game is a new challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment with combinations, plan your moves, and discover how far you can go in the world of <strong>Ellentis</strong>!</p>","developers":["Kielan xD"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586740/79b559771d7d31031c5f3ca59c0f9926fe7213e4/header.jpg?t=1747691882","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright by Dominik Kielanowicz \"KIelan xD\". All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 / Debian 11 / Arch Linux or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4 GHz Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GPU with 512MB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1000 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20